{"id":"15263448","articleId":"13364247","title":"Can I Sell Early?","description":"Yes, you can sell or close your position early.","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"You may sell shares at any point before the market is resolved by either placing a market order to sell shares at the prevailing bid price in the orderbook, or by placing a limit order for how many shares you wish to sell and at what price.","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"The limit order will only be executed if/when there is a willing buyer for your shares at the price you set.","class":"no-margin"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"<br>","class":"no-margin"}],"markdown":null,"author":null,"collectionId":"17859622","targetUserType":"everyone","lastUpdated":"Updated over 7 months ago","lastUpdatedDate":"2026-01-11T21:34:00Z","showTableOfContents":true,"synced":false,"relatedArticles":[{"title":"What is Polymarket","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364060-what-is-polymarket"},{"title":"Limit Orders","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364444-limit-orders"},{"title":"How Are Prices Calculated?","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364488-how-are-prices-calculated"},{"title":"What are Combos?","url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/15458600-what-are-combos"}],"locale":"en","breadcrumbs":[{"url":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/collections/17859622-faqs","name":"FAQs"}],"canonicalUrl":"https://help.polymarket.com/en/articles/13364247-can-i-sell-early","selectedReaction":null,"showReactions":true}